arter Results Top Estimates","src":"www.tokenpost.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTFB0cXl6RmZqaEpOdFA2OFdmTFBrckNTOGxWY052SHZId1I0M2VDdVRNcXpLcVBxRXZOc0VGRU9WLXcwYmNJOHdDZ1JCR0g4bGNVRVREdHp2bXA?oc=5","date":"2026-10-28","zh":""}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":9},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-04","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1932393/000193239326000007/gehc-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"GE HealthCare Technologies Inc. (\"GE HealthCare,\" the \"Company,\" \"our,\" \"us,\" or \"we\") is a leading global healthcare solutions provider of advanced medical technology, pharmaceutical diagnostics, and AI, cloud and software solutions that help clinicians tackle the world's most complex diseases. We have approximately 54,000 colleagues dedicated to our purpose to create a world where healthcare has no limits. Serving patients and providers for nearly 130 years, GE HealthCare is delivering bold innovations designed for the next era of medicine to help clinicians deliver more personalized, precise patient care. This is complemented by our broad service capabilities and dedication to quality and integrity with a strong operational culture, supported by our lean business system, Heartbeat.","zh":"GE HealthCare Technologies Inc.（「GE HealthCare」、「公司」、「我們的」）是全球領先的醫療保健解決方案提供商，提供先進醫療技術、藥物診斷以及人工智慧、雲端和軟體解決方案，幫助臨床醫生應對世界上最複雜的疾病。我們大約有 54,000 名同事致力於創造一個醫療保健無限的世界。 GE HealthCare 為患者和醫療服務提供者提供了近 130 年的服務，正在為下一個醫學時代提供大膽的創新，幫助臨床醫生提供更個人化、精確的患者護理。我們廣泛的服務能力、對品質和誠信的奉獻精神以及強大的營運文化，在我們精益業務系統 Heartbeat 的支持下，對此起到了補充作用。"},{"en":"We generate revenue from the sale of medical devices, consumable products, service capabilities, and AI-enabled cloud and software solutions. We serve customers in over 160 countries with a global team of approximately 9,700 sales professionals and 8,900 field service engineers. Our customers are hospitals, health systems, and researchers, including public, private, academic, and government institutions. Our comprehensive portfolio of solutions addresses the biggest challenges facing healthcare today, and is designed to advance care delivery for customers, reduce disease burden, enable better patient outcomes, and drive sustainable growth for the company. These qualities foster trust, loyalty, and partnership with our global customer base. Our revenues, operating profits, and cash flows vary from quarter to quarter. Financial results in the fourth quarter have historically been higher th","zh":"我們透過銷售醫療設備、消耗品、服務能力以及人工智慧雲端和軟體解決方案來獲得收入。我們的全球團隊由約 9,700 名銷售專業人員和 8,900 名現場服務工程師組成，為 160 多個國家的客戶提供服務。我們的客戶是醫院、衛生系統和研究人員，包括公立、私立、學術和政府機構。我們全面的解決方案組合解決了當今醫療保健面臨的最大挑戰，旨在推進為客戶提供的護理服務，減輕疾病負擔，實現更好的患者治療效果，並推動公司的可持續增長。這些品質促進了我們與全球客戶群的信任、忠誠度和合作關係。我們的收入、營業利潤和現金流量每季都有所不同。第四季的財務表現歷來高於"},{"en":"GE HealthCare Technologies Inc. is a Delaware corporation with corporate headquarters in Chicago, Illinois. On January 3, 2023, the General Electric Company, which now operates as GE Aerospace (\"GE\"), completed the spin-off of GE HealthCare (the \"Spin-Off\").","zh":"GE HealthCare Technologies Inc. 是一家特拉華州公司，公司總部位於伊利諾州芝加哥。 2023 年 1 月 3 日，通用電氣公司（現更名為 GE 航空航太公司（「GE」））完成了 GE HealthCare 的分拆（「分拆」）。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our business is organized into four segments that are aligned with the industries we serve: Imaging, Advanced Visualization Solutions (\"AVS\"), Patient Care Solutions (\"PCS\"), and Pharmaceutical Diagnostics (\"PDx\").","zh":"我們的業務分為與我們所服務的行業一致的四個部分：影像、高級視覺化解決方案（「AVS」）、病患照護解決方案（「PCS」）和藥物診斷（「PDx」）。"},{"en":"Our Imaging segment includes five product lines and associated service capabilities: Molecular Imaging (\"MI\"), Computed Tomography (\"CT\"), Magnetic Resonance (\"MR\"), Women's Health, and X-ray. We manage our Molecular Imaging and Computed Tomography product lines together (\"MI/CT\") and our Women's Health and X-ray product lines together (\"WH/XR\"). Our products support providers in the delivery of care for a broad spectrum of clinical specialties, including oncology, cardiology, neurology, nuclear medicine, orthopedics, women's health, pediatrics, and surgery.","zh":"我們的影像部門包括五個產品線和相關服務能力：分子影像（「MI」）、電腦斷層掃描（「CT」）、磁振造影（「MR」）、女性健康和 X 光。我們共同管理分子影像和電腦斷層掃描產品線（“MI/CT”）以及女性健康和 X 光產品線（“WH/XR”）。我們的產品支援提供者提供廣泛的臨床專業護理，包括腫瘤學、心臟病學、神經病學、核子醫學、骨科、婦女健康、兒科和外科。"}],"customers":[],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Imaging","val":9245000000,"zh":"Imaging"},{"name":"AVS","val":5354000000,"zh":"AVS 部門"},{"name":"PCS","val":3086000000,"zh":"PCS部門"},{"name":"P Dx","val":2900000000,"zh":"P Dx 段"}],"total":20625000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Product","val":13661000000,"zh":"產品"},{"name":"Service","val":6964000000,"zh":"服務"}],"total":20625000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Other Countries","val":9427000000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"US","val":9168000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"CN","val":2031000000,"zh":"中國"}],"total":20625000000}},"peers":["GEV","WAB","VTRS","KVUE","HWM"]}}